# StudyOS — Trivy Container Scanning
# Usage: trivy image studyos-api:latest
#        trivy image studyos-web:latest
# CI: Automatically runs on every build

# .trivyignore
# Ignore specific CVEs with justification

# False positives in Python base image
CVE-2023-45273  # Go crypto library issue — not used by Python runtime

# Low severity issues with no exploit path
CVE-2024-0567   # OpenSSL info leak — mitigated by TLS config
CVE-2023-5678   # zlib compression issue — not exploitable in our usage

# Accepted risks
CVE-2024-1234   # Low severity, fix pending upstream base image update
